img\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" href=\\\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!2w3w!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fedb0e4d3-e838-478d-9e7b-7e20284354f6_940x788.png\\\" data-component-name=\\\"Image2ToDOM\\\"><div class=\\\"image2-inset\\\"><picture><source type=\\\"image/webp\\\" srcset=\\\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!2w3w!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fedb0e4d3-e838-478d-9e7b-7e20284354f6_940x788.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!2w3w!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fedb0e4d3-e838-478d-9e7b-7e20284354f6_940x788.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!2w3w!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fedb0e4d3-e838-478d-9e7b-7e20284354f6_940x788.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!2w3w!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fedb0e4d3-e838-478d-9e7b-7e20284354f6_940x788.png 1456w\\\" sizes=\\\"100vw\\\"><img src=\\\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!2w3w!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fedb0e4d3-e838-478d-9e7b-7e20284354f6_940x788.png\\\" width=\\\"940\\\" height=\\\"788\\\" data-attrs=\\\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/edb0e4d3-e838-478d-9e7b-7e20284354f6_940x788.png&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:788,&quot;width&quot;:940,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:null,&quot;bytes&quot;:1175855,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:false,&quot;topImage&quot;:true,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:&quot;https://carmenauthenticallyadhd.substack.com/i/186406461?img=https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fedb0e4d3-e838-478d-9e7b-7e20284354f6_940x788.png&quot;,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\\\" class=\\\"sizing-normal\\\" alt=\\\"\\\" srcset=\\\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!2w3w!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fedb0e4d3-e838-478d-9e7b-7e20284354f6_940x788.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!2w3w!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fedb0e4d3-e838-478d-9e7b-7e20284354f6_940x788.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!2w3w!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fedb0e4d3-e838-478d-9e7b-7e20284354f6_940x788.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!2w3w!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fedb0e4d3-e838-478d-9e7b-7e20284354f6_940x788.png 1456w\\\" sizes=\\\"100vw\\\" fetchpriority=\\\"high\\\"></picture><div class=\\\"image-link-expand\\\"><div class=\\\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset\\\"><button tabindex=\\\"0\\\" type=\\\"button\\\" class=\\\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\\\"><svg aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\" width=\\\"20\\\" height=\\\"20\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 20 20\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" stroke-width=\\\"1.5\\\" stroke=\\\"var(--color-fg-primary)\\\" stroke-linecap=\\\"round\\\" stroke-linejoin=\\\"round\\\" xmlns=\\\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\\\" class=\\\"icon-noB79L\\\"><g><path d=\\\"M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882\\\"></path></g></svg></button><button tabindex=\\\"0\\\" type=\\\"button\\\" class=\\\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\\\"><svg xmlns=\\\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\\\" width=\\\"20\\\" height=\\\"20\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" stroke=\\\"currentColor\\\" stroke-width=\\\"2\\\" stroke-linecap=\\\"round\\\" stroke-linejoin=\\\"round\\\" class=\\\"lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2 icon-noB79L\\\"><polyline points=\\\"15 3 21 3 21 9\\\"></polyline><polyline points=\\\"9 21 3 21 3 15\\\"></polyline><line x1=\\\"21\\\" x2=\\\"14\\\" y1=\\\"3\\\" y2=\\\"10\\\"></line><line x1=\\\"3\\\" x2=\\\"10\\\" y1=\\\"21\\\" y2=\\\"14\\\"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a></figure></div><p>AuDHD (autism + ADHD) can feel like living with two operating systems at once: one craves pattern, predictability, and sensory truth; the other craves novelty, urgency, and dopamine. When you add <strong>alexithymia</strong> (trouble identifying/putting words to feelings) and <strong>anhedonia</strong> (reduced interest/pleasure), it can feel like your inner world is running on <em>silent mode</em>\u2014or like emotions are happening in the background, but the app won\u2019t open.</p><p>This isn\u2019t a personal failure. It\u2019s brain wiring, body signals, and overload physics.</p><p>Let\u2019s break down what these are, why they show up so often in neurodivergent lives, how they affect kids <em>and</em> adults, and what actually helps\u2014plus journal prompts that feel like a flashlight, not a courtroom.</p><div><hr></div><h2>What is alexithymia?</h2><p><strong>Alexithymia</strong> is a trait (not a diagnosis) involving:</p><ul><li><p>difficulty identifying feelings</p></li><li><p>difficulty describing feelings</p></li><li><p>a tendency toward \u201Cexternally oriented thinking\u201D (focusing on facts/tasks over inner states)</p></li></ul><p>In plain language: your body may be broadcasting emotion\u2026 but your brain is struggling to translate the signal into words.</p><h3>The neuroscience-y \u201Cwhy\u201D</h3><p>A big piece here is <strong>interoception</strong>\u2014your brain\u2019s ability to notice and interpret internal body signals (heart rate, tight chest, nausea, heat, hunger, fatigue). Research suggests alexithymia is strongly linked with interoceptive differences, and in autism research, alexithymia (not autism traits alone) can explain certain interoceptive difficulties.</p><p>So if your internal signals are \u201Cblurry,\u201D emotions often become:</p><ul><li><p><strong>mystery symptoms</strong> (headache, stomach drop, jaw clench, sudden irritability)</p></li><li><p><strong>surprise explosions</strong> (because the warning signs didn\u2019t register clearly)</p></li><li><p><strong>shutdowns</strong> (because the system gets overwhelmed and pulls the plug)</p></li></ul><div class=\\\"captioned-image-container\\\"><figure><a class=\\\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" href=\\\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!sZIf!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F806e55b4-0519-4d5d-b04a-1eeb08204c3e_1536x1024.png\\\" data-component-name=\\\"Image2ToDOM\\\"><div class=\\\"image2-inset\\\"><picture><source type=\\\"image/webp\\\" srcset=\\\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!sZIf!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F806e55b4-0519-4d5d-b04a-1eeb08204c3e_1536x1024.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!sZIf!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F806e55b4-0519-4d5d-b04a-1eeb08204c3e_1536x1024.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!sZIf!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F806e55b4-0519-4d5d-b04a-1eeb08204c3e_1536x1024.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!sZIf!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F806e55b4-0519-4d5d-b04a-1eeb08204c3e_1536x1024.png 1456w\\\" sizes=\\\"100vw\\\"><img src=\\\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!sZIf!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F806e55b4-0519-4d5d-b04a-1eeb08204c3e_1536x1024.png\\\" width=\\\"1456\\\" height=\\\"971\\\" data-attrs=\\\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/806e55b4-0519-4d5d-b04a-1eeb08204c3e_1536x1024.png&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:971,&quot;width&quot;:1456,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:null,&quot;bytes&quot;:3059134,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:true,&quot;topImage&quot;:false,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:&quot;https://carmenauthenticallyadhd.substack.com/i/186406461?img=https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F806e55b4-0519-4d5d-b04a-1eeb08204c3e_1536x1024.png&quot;,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\\\" class=\\\"sizing-normal\\\" alt=\\\"\\\" srcset=\\\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!sZIf!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F806e55b4-0519-4d5d-b04a-1eeb08204c3e_1536x1024.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!sZIf!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F806e55b4-0519-4d5d-b04a-1eeb08204c3e_1536x1024.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!sZIf!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F806e55b4-0519-4d5d-b04a-1eeb08204c3e_1536x1024.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!sZIf!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F806e55b4-0519-4d5d-b04a-1eeb08204c3e_1536x1024.png 1456w\\\" sizes=\\\"100vw\\\" loading=\\\"lazy\\\"></picture><div class=\\\"image-link-expand\\\"><div class=\\\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset\\\"><button tabindex=\\\"0\\\" type=\\\"button\\\" class=\\\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\\\"><svg aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\" width=\\\"20\\\" height=\\\"20\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 20 20\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" stroke-width=\\\"1.5\\\" stroke=\\\"var(--color-fg-primary)\\\" stroke-linecap=\\\"round\\\" stroke-linejoin=\\\"round\\\" xmlns=\\\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\\\" class=\\\"icon-noB79L\\\"><g><path d=\\\"M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882\\\"></path></g></svg></button><button tabindex=\\\"0\\\" type=\\\"button\\\" class=\\\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\\\"><svg xmlns=\\\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\\\" width=\\\"20\\\" height=\\\"20\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" stroke=\\\"currentColor\\\" stroke-width=\\\"2\\\" stroke-linecap=\\\"round\\\" stroke-linejoin=\\\"round\\\" class=\\\"lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2 icon-noB79L\\\"><polyline points=\\\"15 3 21 3 21 9\\\"></polyline><polyline points=\\\"9 21 3 21 3 15\\\"></polyline><line x1=\\\"21\\\" x2=\\\"14\\\" y1=\\\"3\\\" y2=\\\"10\\\"></line><line x1=\\\"3\\\" x2=\\\"10\\\" y1=\\\"21\\\" y2=\\\"14\\\"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a></figure></div><p></p><h3>How common is it in autism and ADHD?</h3><p>A major review found alexithymia prevalence in autistic groups ranging roughly <strong>33%\u201363%</strong>, with a weighted average around <strong>~50%</strong> in the studies reviewed. <br>And in one adult ADHD sample, alexithymia showed up at a notably higher rate in the ADHD group than controls.</p><p>For AuDHD folks, it\u2019s not rare\u2014it\u2019s a frequent roommate.</p><div><hr></div><h2>What is anhedonia?</h2><p><strong>Anhedonia</strong> is <strong>markedly reduced interest or pleasure</strong> in activities that used to feel good. It can show up as:</p><ul><li><p>\u201CI <em>know</em> I like this\u2026 but I can\u2019t feel it.\u201D</p></li><li><p>\u201CNothing sounds appealing.\u201D</p></li><li><p>\u201CEven fun feels like effort.\u201D</p></li></ul><p>Clinically, anhedonia is a core symptom in depression and other conditions, but it can also appear with burnout, chronic stress, trauma responses, and neurodivergent overload cycles.</p><h3>Two flavors that matter</h3><p>Researchers often talk about:</p><ul><li><p><strong>anticipatory pleasure</strong> (\u201Cwanting\u201D / motivation / looking forward to it)</p></li><li><p><strong>consummatory pleasure</strong> (\u201Cliking\u201D / enjoyment in the moment)</p></li></ul><p>You can have either one disrupted\u2014like wanting without liking, or liking without wanting (hello, \u201CI enjoy it once I start, but starting is impossible\u201D).</p><div class=\\\"captioned-image-container\\\"><figure><a class=\\\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" href=\\\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!p4Q1!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F714ac7ec-ec3d-42a8-8c38-7bf12a5cd628_1536x1024.png\\\" data-component-name=\\\"Image2ToDOM\\\"><div class=\\\"image2-inset\\\"><picture><source type=\\\"image/webp\\\" srcset=\\\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!p4Q1!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F714ac7ec-ec3d-42a8-8c38-7bf12a5cd628_1536x1024.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!p4Q1!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F714ac7ec-ec3d-42a8-8c38-7bf12a5cd628_1536x1024.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!p4Q1!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F714ac7ec-ec3d-42a8-8c38-7bf12a5cd628_1536x1024.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!p4Q1!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F714ac7ec-ec3d-42a8-8c38-7bf12a5cd628_1536x1024.png 1456w\\\" sizes=\\\"100vw\\\"><img src=\\\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!p4Q1!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F714ac7ec-ec3d-42a8-8c38-7bf12a5cd628_1536x1024.png\\\" width=\\\"1456\\\" height=\\\"971\\\" data-attrs=\\\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/714ac7ec-ec3d-42a8-8c38-7bf12a5cd628_1536x1024.png&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:971,&quot;width&quot;:1456,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:null,&quot;bytes&quot;:3329385,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:true,&quot;topImage&quot;:false,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:&quot;https://carmenauthenticallyadhd.substack.com/i/186406461?img=https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F714ac7ec-ec3d-42a8-8c38-7bf12a5cd628_1536x1024.png&quot;,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\\\" class=\\\"sizing-normal\\\" alt=\\\"\\\" srcset=\\\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!p4Q1!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F714ac7ec-ec3d-42a8-8c38-7bf12a5cd628_1536x1024.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!p4Q1!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F714ac7ec-ec3d-42a8-8c38-7bf12a5cd628_1536x1024.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!p4Q1!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F714ac7ec-ec3d-42a8-8c38-7bf12a5cd628_1536x1024.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!p4Q1!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F714ac7ec-ec3d-42a8-8c38-7bf12a5cd628_1536x1024.png 1456w\\\" sizes=\\\"100vw\\\" loading=\\\"lazy\\\"></picture><div class=\\\"image-link-expand\\\"><div class=\\\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset\\\"><button tabindex=\\\"0\\\" type=\\\"button\\\" class=\\\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\\\"><svg aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\" width=\\\"20\\\" height=\\\"20\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 20 20\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" stroke-width=\\\"1.5\\\" stroke=\\\"var(--color-fg-primary)\\\" stroke-linecap=\\\"round\\\" stroke-linejoin=\\\"round\\\" xmlns=\\\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\\\" class=\\\"icon-noB79L\\\"><g><path d=\\\"M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882\\\"></path></g></svg></button><button tabindex=\\\"0\\\" type=\\\"button\\\" class=\\\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\\\"><svg xmlns=\\\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\\\" width=\\\"20\\\" height=\\\"20\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" stroke=\\\"currentColor\\\" stroke-width=\\\"2\\\" stroke-linecap=\\\"round\\\" stroke-linejoin=\\\"round\\\" class=\\\"lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2 icon-noB79L\\\"><polyline points=\\\"15 3 21 3 21 9\\\"></polyline><polyline points=\\\"9 21 3 21 3 15\\\"></polyline><line x1=\\\"21\\\" x2=\\\"14\\\" y1=\\\"3\\\" y2=\\\"10\\\"></line><line x1=\\\"3\\\" x2=\\\"10\\\" y1=\\\"21\\\" y2=\\\"14\\\"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a></figure></div><h3>The brain circuitry piece</h3><p>Anhedonia is tightly tied to <strong>reward processing</strong>\u2014especially circuits involving the <strong>ventral striatum/nucleus accumbens</strong> and dopamine signaling.</p><p>And here\u2019s where AuDHD comes in:</p><ul><li><p>ADHD research often finds atypical reward processing and dopaminergic signaling differences involving striatal circuits, which can show up as motivation problems and \u201Cnow vs later\u201D friction.</p></li><li><p>Autism research includes evidence for differences in social reward \u201Cwanting\u201D and ventral striatal responses in some contexts\u2014meaning social rewards may not reliably light up the brain\u2019s reward engine the same way, especially under stress/uncertainty.</p></li></ul><div><hr></div><h2>Why alexithymia + anhedonia can travel together in AuDHD</h2><p>Picture this like a two-step problem:</p><ol><li><p><strong>Alexithymia</strong> makes it harder to <em>identify what you feel and need</em>.</p></li><li><p><strong>Anhedonia</strong> makes it harder to <em>access the \u201Cthis feels good\u201D signal that fuels motivation and connection.</em></p></li></ol><p>So the brain loses both:</p><ul><li><p>the <strong>map</strong> (what\u2019s going on inside me?)</p></li><li><p>and the <strong>reward beacon</strong> (what would help and feel good?)</p></li></ul><p>And when you can\u2019t name what\u2019s wrong, you can\u2019t target support. When you can\u2019t feel reward, your brain stops trying. That\u2019s not laziness\u2014that\u2019s conservation mode.</p><p>Add AuDHD factors:</p><ul><li><p>sensory overload</p></li><li><p>masking</p></li><li><p>executive dysfunction</p></li><li><p>social uncertainty fatigue</p></li><li><p>demand avoidance / threat responses to pressure</p></li></ul><p>\u2026and your nervous system starts treating daily life like a low-grade emergency.</p><div class=\\\"captioned-image-container\\\"><figure><a class=\\\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" href=\\\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!d3zm!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fa5f024ee-91b4-430c-8ed2-ba0cc4bc86b3_1536x1024.png\\\" data-component-name=\\\"Image2ToDOM\\\"><div class=\\\"image2-inset\\\"><picture><source type=\\\"image/webp\\\" srcset=\\\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!d3zm!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fa5f024ee-91b4-430c-8ed2-ba0cc4bc86b3_1536x1024.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!d3zm!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fa5f024ee-91b4-430c-8ed2-ba0cc4bc86b3_1536x1024.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!d3zm!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fa5f024ee-91b4-430c-8ed2-ba0cc4bc86b3_1536x1024.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!d3zm!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fa5f024ee-91b4-430c-8ed2-ba0cc4bc86b3_1536x1024.png 1456w\\\" sizes=\\\"100vw\\\"><img src=\\\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!d3zm!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fa5f024ee-91b4-430c-8ed2-ba0cc4bc86b3_1536x1024.png\\\" width=\\\"1456\\\" height=\\\"971\\\" data-attrs=\\\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/a5f024ee-91b4-430c-8ed2-ba0cc4bc86b3_1536x1024.png&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:971,&quot;width&quot;:1456,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:null,&quot;bytes&quot;:3499224,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:true,&quot;topImage&quot;:false,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:&quot;https://carmenauthenticallyadhd.substack.com/i/186406461?img=https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fa5f024ee-91b4-430c-8ed2-ba0cc4bc86b3_1536x1024.png&quot;,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\\\" class=\\\"sizing-normal\\\" alt=\\\"\\\" srcset=\\\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!d3zm!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fa5f024ee-91b4-430c-8ed2-ba0cc4bc86b3_1536x1024.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!d3zm!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fa5f024ee-91b4-430c-8ed2-ba0cc4bc86b3_1536x1024.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!d3zm!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fa5f024ee-91b4-430c-8ed2-ba0cc4bc86b3_1536x1024.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!d3zm!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fa5f024ee-91b4-430c-8ed2-ba0cc4bc86b3_1536x1024.png 1456w\\\" sizes=\\\"100vw\\\" loading=\\\"lazy\\\"></picture><div class=\\\"image-link-expand\\\"><div class=\\\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset\\\"><button tabindex=\\\"0\\\" type=\\\"button\\\" class=\\\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\\\"><svg aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\" width=\\\"20\\\" height=\\\"20\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 20 20\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" stroke-width=\\\"1.5\\\" stroke=\\\"var(--color-fg-primary)\\\" stroke-linecap=\\\"round\\\" stroke-linejoin=\\\"round\\\" xmlns=\\\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\\\" class=\\\"icon-noB79L\\\"><g><path d=\\\"M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882\\\"></path></g></svg></button><button tabindex=\\\"0\\\" type=\\\"button\\\" class=\\\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\\\"><svg xmlns=\\\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\\\" width=\\\"20\\\" height=\\\"20\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" stroke=\\\"currentColor\\\" stroke-width=\\\"2\\\" stroke-linecap=\\\"round\\\" stroke-linejoin=\\\"round\\\" class=\\\"lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2 icon-noB79L\\\"><polyline points=\\\"15 3 21 3 21 9\\\"></polyline><polyline points=\\\"9 21 3 21 3 15\\\"></polyline><line x1=\\\"21\\\" x2=\\\"14\\\" y1=\\\"3\\\" y2=\\\"10\\\"></line><line x1=\\\"3\\\" x2=\\\"10\\\" y1=\\\"21\\\" y2=\\\"14\\\"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a></figure></div><div><hr></div><h2>How this can look in adults</h2><h3>Alexithymia in adults can sound like:</h3><ul><li><p>\u201CI don\u2019t know how I feel. I just know I\u2019m <em>off</em>.\u201D</p></li><li><p>\u201CI\u2019m fine.\u201D (translation: I have no data)</p></li><li><p>\u201CI\u2019m not emotional.\u201D (translation: I don\u2019t have labels, not that I lack feelings)</p></li><li><p>conflict that escalates fast because the <em>first recognized emotion is the big one</em></p></li></ul><p>It can also impact relationships because feelings don\u2019t get communicated early\u2014so partners/friends only see the <strong>shutdown</strong> or <strong>snap</strong>, not the slow build.</p><h3>Anhedonia in adults can look like:</h3><ul><li><p>doomscrolling because nothing else lands</p></li><li><p>losing interest in hobbies, music, intimacy, food, social plans</p></li><li><p>\u201CI can\u2019t start fun, only obligations\u201D (and even those are brutal)</p></li><li><p>emotional flatness that scares you because you remember being someone who felt things</p></li></ul><p>Important reality check: anhedonia can be a depression signal. If it\u2019s persistent, worsening, or paired with hopelessness, sleep/appetite changes, or thoughts of self-harm\u2014loop in a clinician. Not because you\u2019re broken, but because you deserve backup.</p><div><hr></div><h2>How this can look in kids</h2><p>Kids often don\u2019t have the vocabulary even <em>without</em> alexithymia. With AuDHD + alexithymia/anhedonia, it can show up as behavior, not words.</p><h3>Alexithymia-ish patterns in kids:</h3><ul><li><p>lots of \u201CI don\u2019t know\u201D when asked about feelings</p></li><li><p>big reactions that seem \u201Cout of nowhere\u201D</p></li><li><p>body complaints (tummy, headache) instead of emotion labels</p></li><li><p>difficulty with empathy <em>language</em> even if they care deeply</p></li><li><p>trouble explaining what happened after a meltdown (\u201CI forgot,\u201D \u201Cnothing,\u201D \u201Che did it\u201D)</p></li></ul><h3>Anhedonia-ish patterns in kids:</h3><ul><li><p>less interest in play they used to love</p></li><li><p>\u201Cmeh\u201D response to rewards that used to work</p></li><li><p>social withdrawal or \u201Cparallel-only\u201D preference increasing</p></li><li><p>irritability replacing joy (very common\u2014especially in kids)</p></li></ul><p>And because AuDHD kids can live in chronic overwhelm, what looks like \u201Cnot interested\u201D may be <strong>protected capacity</strong>: their nervous system is rationing energy.</p><div><hr></div><h2>The sneaky thing: shutdown can masquerade as anhedonia</h2><p>Sometimes the issue isn\u2019t \u201CI can\u2019t feel pleasure\u201D so much as:</p><ul><li><p>I\u2019m <strong>overloaded</strong></p></li><li><p>I\u2019m <strong>dissociated</strong></p></li><li><p>I\u2019m <strong>shutdown</strong></p></li><li><p>I\u2019m <strong>depleted</strong></p></li><li><p>I\u2019m <strong>unsafe</strong></p></li></ul><p>When safety drops, pleasure drops. Joy is not a moral achievement; it\u2019s a nervous system permission slip.</p><div><hr></div><h2>Supports that actually help</h2><p>Podcast Reccomendation: </p><div class=\\\"digest-post-embed\\\" data-attrs=\\\"{&quot;nodeId&quot;:&quot;e8547107-99cb-44ea-80a8-8da615b41db1&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Authentically ADHD \u2013 ADHD, Alexithymia, and Anhedonia: Understanding Emotions and Motivation&quot;,&quot;cta&quot;:&quot;Listen now&quot;,&quot;showBylines&quot;:true,&quot;showDescription&quot;:true,&quot;showImage&quot;:true,&quot;size&quot;:&quot;lg&quot;,&quot;isEditorNode&quot;:true,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;Authentically ADHD \u2013 ADHD, Alexithymia, and Anhedonia: Understanding Emotions and Motivation&quot;,&quot;publishedBylines&quot;:[{&quot;id&quot;:109463432,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;carmen_authenticallyadhd&quot;,&quot;bio&quot;:&quot;Hi \uD83D\uDC4B I'm an Early childhood special education teacher, a late diagnosed ADHDer, Podcast host of Authentically ADHD with Carmen and a certified Life and performance coach. &quot;,&quot;photo_url&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/0dc9e3bc-979a-440d-8aed-b358d99d34ac_3000x3000.png&quot;,&quot;is_guest&quot;:false,&quot;bestseller_tier&quot;:null}],&quot;post_date&quot;:&quot;2025-07-05T05:28:20.342Z&quot;,&quot;cover_image&quot;:&quot;https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!uFO0!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F6bb58e4b-57ba-4244-b354-9cdb3463f0db_3000x3000.png&quot;,&quot;cover_image_alt&quot;:null,&quot;canonical_url&quot;:&quot;https://carmenauthenticallyadhd.substack.com/p/authentically-adhd-adhd-alexithymia&quot;,&quot;section_name&quot;:null,&quot;video_upload_id&quot;:null,&quot;id&quot;:164823777,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;podcast&quot;,&quot;reaction_count&quot;:3,&quot;comment_count&quot;:0,&quot;publication_id&quot;:4456750,&quot;publication_name&quot;:&quot;carmen_authenticallyadhd&quot;,&quot;publication_logo_url&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:true,&quot;youtube_url&quot;:null,&quot;show_links&quot;:null,&quot;feed_url&quot;:null}\\\"></div><h3>1) Build an \u201Cemotion translation\u201D bridge (body \u2192 word \u2192 need)</h3><p>Because if feelings are subtitles, we can generate them manually.</p><p><strong>Tools:</strong></p><ul><li><p>Emotion wheel (start with 6 basic emotions, then get fancy)</p></li><li><p>Body map: \u201CWhere do I feel it?\u201D</p></li><li><p>Sentence stems:</p><ul><li><p>\u201CI might be feeling ___ because ___.\u201D</p></li><li><p>\u201CMy body is doing ___, which might mean ___.\u201D</p></li><li><p>\u201CIf this feeling had a job, it would be trying to ___.\u201D</p></li></ul></li></ul><p><strong>Micro-skill goal:</strong> not perfect accuracy\u2014<em>better signal.</em><br>Interoception + alexithymia links make this a high-impact target.</p><div><hr></div><h3>2) Use interoception training like it\u2019s a superpower, not homework</h3><p>Try 30\u201360 seconds, 1\u20133 times a day:</p><ul><li><p>heart: fast/steady?</p></li><li><p>breath: shallow/deep?</p></li><li><p>jaw/shoulders: tight/soft?</p></li><li><p>stomach: open/knotted?</p></li><li><p>temperature: warm/cold?</p></li><li><p>energy: drained/ok/buzzy?</p></li></ul><p>Then label <strong>one</strong> word: <em>tense, heavy, buzzy, blank, tender, sharp.</em></p><p>You\u2019re building the \u201Csignal clarity\u201D pipeline.</p><div><hr></div><h3>3) Separate pleasure from performance</h3><p>AuDHD brains often turn hobbies into jobs. Then anhedonia strolls in like, \u201CCongrats, now nothing is fun.\u201D</p><p><strong>Rule:</strong> pick activities with <strong>no output requirement</strong>.</p><ul><li><p>sensory pleasures (warm shower, weighted blanket, sour candy, crunchy snacks, music in the dark)</p></li><li><p>\u201Cprocess hobbies\u201D (doodling, organizing beads, knitting, miniature kits)</p></li><li><p>nature + movement snacks</p></li></ul><div><hr></div><h3>4) Treat reward like a timid cat: gentle, consistent, no sudden grabbing</h3><p>When reward systems are glitchy, the answer isn\u2019t \u201Ctry harder.\u201D<br>It\u2019s <strong>smaller, sooner, more certain</strong>.</p><p>ADHD reward research repeatedly highlights \u201Cnow vs later\u201D friction and the importance of immediacy/feedback loops.</p><p><strong>Try:</strong></p><ul><li><p>2-minute start + immediate micro-reward</p></li><li><p>\u201Cafter I start, I can stop\u201D rule (reduces threat)</p></li><li><p>visual progress (stickers, checkmarks, done lists)</p></li><li><p>body doubling for activation (social dopamine without heavy social demand)</p></li></ul><div class=\\\"captioned-image-container\\\"><figure><a class=\\\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" href=\\\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!r2hG!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F4576d9e9-091a-467c-aaf2-cfdb1ffea511_1536x1024.png\\\" data-component-name=\\\"Image2ToDOM\\\"><div class=\\\"image2-inset\\\"><picture><source type=\\\"image/webp\\\" srcset=\\\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!r2hG!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F4576d9e9-091a-467c-aaf2-cfdb1ffea511_1536x1024.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!r2hG!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F4576d9e9-091a-467c-aaf2-cfdb1ffea511_1536x1024.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!r2hG!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F4576d9e9-091a-467c-aaf2-cfdb1ffea511_1536x1024.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!r2hG!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F4576d9e9-091a-467c-aaf2-cfdb1ffea511_1536x1024.png 1456w\\\" sizes=\\\"100vw\\\"><img src=\\\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!r2hG!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F4576d9e9-091a-467c-aaf2-cfdb1ffea511_1536x1024.png\\\" width=\\\"1456\\\" height=\\\"971\\\" data-attrs=\\\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/4576d9e9-091a-467c-aaf2-cfdb1ffea511_1536x1024.png&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:971,&quot;width&quot;:1456,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:null,&quot;bytes&quot;:3499879,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:true,&quot;topImage&quot;:false,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:&quot;https://carmenauthenticallyadhd.substack.com/i/186406461?img=https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F4576d9e9-091a-467c-aaf2-cfdb1ffea511_1536x1024.png&quot;,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\\\" class=\\\"sizing-normal\\\" alt=\\\"\\\" srcset=\\\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!r2hG!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F4576d9e9-091a-467c-aaf2-cfdb1ffea511_1536x1024.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!r2hG!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F4576d9e9-091a-467c-aaf2-cfdb1ffea511_1536x1024.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!r2hG!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F4576d9e9-091a-467c-aaf2-cfdb1ffea511_1536x1024.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!r2hG!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F4576d9e9-091a-467c-aaf2-cfdb1ffea511_1536x1024.png 1456w\\\" sizes=\\\"100vw\\\" loading=\\\"lazy\\\"></picture><div class=\\\"image-link-expand\\\"><div class=\\\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset\\\"><button tabindex=\\\"0\\\" type=\\\"button\\\" class=\\\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\\\"><svg aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\" width=\\\"20\\\" height=\\\"20\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 20 20\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" stroke-width=\\\"1.5\\\" stroke=\\\"var(--color-fg-primary)\\\" stroke-linecap=\\\"round\\\" stroke-linejoin=\\\"round\\\" xmlns=\\\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\\\" class=\\\"icon-noB79L\\\"><g><path d=\\\"M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882\\\"></path></g></svg></button><button tabindex=\\\"0\\\" type=\\\"button\\\" class=\\\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\\\"><svg xmlns=\\\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\\\" width=\\\"20\\\" height=\\\"20\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" stroke=\\\"currentColor\\\" stroke-width=\\\"2\\\" stroke-linecap=\\\"round\\\" stroke-linejoin=\\\"round\\\" class=\\\"lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2 icon-noB79L\\\"><polyline points=\\\"15 3 21 3 21 9\\\"></polyline><polyline points=\\\"9 21 3 21 3 15\\\"></polyline><line x1=\\\"21\\\" x2=\\\"14\\\" y1=\\\"3\\\" y2=\\\"10\\\"></line><line x1=\\\"3\\\" x2=\\\"10\\\" y1=\\\"21\\\" y2=\\\"14\\\"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a></figure></div><div><hr></div><h3>5) Build \u201Csafe joy\u201D on purpose (especially for kids)</h3><p>For kids, think: predictable, sensory-friendly, low-demand.</p><p><strong>Examples:</strong></p><ul><li><p>\u201CJoy menu\u201D board with pictures (3 choices only)</p></li><li><p>routine \u201Cconnection rituals\u201D (same song + cuddle, same book + snack)</p></li><li><p>parallel play invitations (\u201CI\u2019ll build next to you\u201D)</p></li><li><p>interest-based social (dinosaurs &gt; small talk)</p></li></ul><p>Autism reward research suggests that motivation and \u201Cwanting\u201D can be context-sensitive\u2014so make the context safer and more predictable, and you often get more access to engagement.</p><div><hr></div><h3>6) Name needs before they become symptoms</h3><p>Alexithymia can make needs hard to detect\u2014so we externalize.</p><p><strong>Daily needs checklist (adult + kid friendly):</strong></p><ul><li><p>Food?</p></li><li><p>Water?</p></li><li><p>Movement?</p></li><li><p>Quiet?</p></li><li><p>Pressure/comfort?</p></li><li><p>Temperature change?</p></li><li><p>Social break?</p></li><li><p>Transition buffer?</p></li><li><p>Task clarity?</p></li></ul><p>If you can\u2019t identify feelings, identify <strong>conditions</strong>.</p><div><hr></div><h3>7) Get clinical backup when the joy-loss is persistent</h3><p>If anhedonia lasts weeks, worsens, or comes with depression symptoms, it\u2019s worth a professional screen. Anhedonia is a recognized clinical feature in mood disorders, and it\u2019s treatable\u2014but it often needs more than self-help tools.</p><div><hr></div><h2>Reflection prompts: flashlight, not courtroom</h2><h3>A. Alexithymia-friendly prompts (body-first)</h3><ol><li><p><strong>My body today is saying:</strong> (tight / heavy / buzzy / blank / tender / hot / cold)</p></li><li><p><strong>The loudest signal is:</strong> (jaw / chest / stomach / head / shoulders)</p></li><li><p>If this sensation could talk, it would ask for <strong>one</strong> thing: ___</p></li></ol><h3>B. Anhedonia-friendly prompts (permission + tiny steps)</h3><ol start=\\\"4\\\"><li><p>What\u2019s one thing I used to like that feels far away right now?</p></li><li><p>What version of that could be <strong>10% smaller</strong> and still count?</p></li><li><p>What\u2019s a \u201Csafe pleasure\u201D I can access even when I\u2019m flat? (texture, warmth, water, music, pressure, light)</p></li></ol><h3>C. AuDHD reality prompts (reduce shame, increase accuracy)</h3><ol start=\\\"7\\\"><li><p>Am I uninterested\u2014or am I <strong>overloaded</strong>? What\u2019s my best guess?</p></li><li><p>What demand is my nervous system interpreting as threat right now?</p></li><li><p>What would make today feel <strong>more navigable</strong> (not perfect)?</p></li></ol><h3>D. Connection prompts (for adults, partners, parents)</h3><ol start=\\\"10\\\"><li><p>If I could communicate one sentence about my inner world today, it would be:</p></li><li><p>The kindest interpretation of my behavior this week is:</p></li><li><p>One support I can ask for without overexplaining is:</p></li></ol><h3>E. Kid-friendly versions (simple + concrete)</h3><ul><li><p>My body feels: \u2610 fast \u2610 slow \u2610 tight \u2610 wiggly \u2610 heavy \u2610 tired</p></li><li><p>I might need: \u2610 snack \u2610 quiet \u2610 squeeze \u2610 help \u2610 break \u2610 move</p></li><li><p>One thing that helps me feel better is: ___</p></li></ul><div><hr></div><h2>A closing note (because you deserve one)</h2><p>If you grew up thinking you were \u201Cbad at feelings,\u201D I want you to hear this clearly:</p><p>You are not cold. You are not broken. You are not failing at being human.</p><p>You\u2019re running a brain-body system that sometimes sends signals in riddles and sometimes mutes the reward channel to conserve power. The work isn\u2019t to become a different person. The work is to build <strong>translation tools</strong>, reduce <strong>overload</strong>, and create <strong>safe pathways back to pleasure</strong>\u2014one tiny, stubborn step at a time.</p><p></p><p class=\\\"button-wrapper\\\" data-attrs=\\\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://carmenauthenticallyadhd.substack.com/p/audhd-alexithymia-and-anhedonia-when/comments&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Leave a comment&quot;,&quot;action&quot;:null,&quot;class&quot;:null}\\\" data-component-name=\\\"ButtonCreateButton\\\"><a class=\\\"button primary\\\" href=\\\"https://carmenauthenticallyadhd.substack.com/p/audhd-alexithymia-and-anhedonia-when/comments\\\"><span>Leave a comment</span></a></p><div class=\\\"subscription-widget-wrap-editor\\\" data-attrs=\\\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://carmenauthenticallyadhd.substack.com/subscribe?&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Subscribe&quot;,&quot;language&quot;:&quot;en&quot;}\\\" data-component-name=\\\"SubscribeWidgetToDOM\\\"><div class=\\\"subscription-widget show-subscribe\\\"><div class=\\\"preamble\\\"><p class=\\\"cta-caption\\\">This Substack is reader-supported. To receive new posts and support my work, consider becoming a free or paid subscriber.</p></div><form class=\\\"subscription-widget-subscribe\\\"><input type=\\\"email\\\" class=\\\"email-input\\\" name=\\\"email\\\" placeholder=\\\"Type your email\u2026\\\" tabindex=\\\"-1\\\"><input type=\\\"submit\\\" class=\\\"button primary\\\" value=\\\"Subscribe\\\"><div class=\\\"fake-input-wrapper\\\"><div class=\\\"fake-input\\\"></div><div class=\\\"fake-button\\\"></div></div></form></div></div><p></p><div class=\\\"directMessage button\\\" data-attrs=\\\"{&quot;userId&quot;:109463432,&quot;userName&quot;:&quot;carmen_authenticallyadhd&quot;,&quot;canDm&quot;:null,&quot;dmUpgradeOptions&quot;:null,&quot;isEditorNode&quot;:true}\\\" data-component-name=\\\"DirectMessageToDOM\\\"></div><p></p><div class=\\\"captioned-image-container\\\"><figure><a class=\\\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" href=\\\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!4xok!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fa9cbff3a-43d8-4f21-aab3-ac716ccc4e9c_1024x1536.png\\\" data-component-name=\\\"Image2ToDOM\\\"><div class=\\\"image2-inset\\\"><picture><source type=\\\"image/webp\\\" srcset=\\\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!4xok!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fa9cbff3a-43d8-4f21-aab3-ac716ccc4e9c_1024x1536.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!4xok!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fa9cbff3a-43d8-4f21-aab3-ac716ccc4e9c_1024x1536.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!4xok!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fa9cbff3a-43d8-4f21-aab3-ac716ccc4e9c_1024x1536.p